{%- doc -%}
  "NASIL CALISIR?" PANELININ IKONLARI

  Temadaki snippets/tt-sc-ikon.liquid ile ayni desen: tek bir case,
  tek bir cizim dili. Tabler/Lucide gibi bir set temada YOK, bu yuzden
  ikonlar elle cizildi; hepsi ayni olculerde ve ayni agirlikta:

    viewBox 24x24, fill="none", stroke="currentColor",
    stroke-width 1.8, yuvarlak uclar ve birlesimler.

  NITELIKLER HER SVG'YE ACIKCA YAZILIYOR

  Once ortak nitelikler tek bir degiskende toplanip {{ sv }} ile
  basiliyordu. Kisaydi ama iki sorunu vardi: cizimin nasil
  gorunecegi dosyada okunmuyordu ve nitelikleri metin olarak basmak
  kacisla ilgili sessiz hatalara acikti -- nitelik kaybolunca SVG
  varsayilanina, yani IcI DOLU SIYAH'a duser. Tekrar pahasina
  acikca yaziliyorlar.

  Renk her zaman currentColor -- kutunun rengi degisince ikon da
  degisiyor. Tek istisna "halkalar": couple'i anlattigi icin iki
  halka farkli renkte, ikisi de CSS degiskeninden geliyor.

  @param {string} ad - parilti | kilit | halkalar | takvim-kalp | oklar | ok | kapat
  @param {string} [sinif] - ek CSS sinifi

  @example
  {%- render 'tt-nc-ikon', ad: 'parilti' -%}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- case ad -%}
  {%- when 'parilti' -%}
    <svg class="tt-nc-ikon {{ sinif }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M12 3.2 13.55 8.45 18.8 10 13.55 11.55 12 16.8 10.45 11.55 5.2 10 10.45 8.45Z"/>
      <path d="M18.4 15.2 19.05 17.15 21 17.8 19.05 18.45 18.4 20.4 17.75 18.45 15.8 17.8 17.75 17.15Z"/>
      <path d="M5.6 3.6 6.05 4.95 7.4 5.4 6.05 5.85 5.6 7.2 5.15 5.85 3.8 5.4 5.15 4.95Z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'kilit' -%}
    <svg class="tt-nc-ikon {{ sinif }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <rect x="4.8" y="10.4" width="14.4" height="9.4" rx="2.2"/>
      <path d="M8.2 10.4V7.6a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 7.6 0v2.8"/>
      <path d="M12 14.2v2"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'halkalar' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Ic ice gecmis iki halka: couple. Soldaki koyu, sagdaki acik --
      renkler CSS degiskeninden, boylece kart ikonunun rengiyle
      birlikte degisiyorlar.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="tt-nc-ikon {{ sinif }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="9.2" cy="12" r="5.4" stroke="var(--tt-nc-halka-1, currentColor)"/>
      <circle cx="14.8" cy="12" r="5.4" stroke="var(--tt-nc-halka-2, currentColor)"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'takvim-kalp' -%}
    <svg class="tt-nc-ikon {{ sinif }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <rect x="3.6" y="5.2" width="16.8" height="15.2" rx="2.6"/>
      <path d="M3.6 9.8h16.8M8.2 3.4v3.4M15.8 3.4v3.4"/>
      <path d="M12 18.1c-1.9-1.2-3.1-2.3-3.1-3.6a1.7 1.7 0 0 1 3.1-.95 1.7 1.7 0 0 1 3.1.95c0 1.3-1.2 2.4-3.1 3.6Z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'oklar' -%}
    <svg class="tt-nc-ikon {{ sinif }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M3.8 8.6h13.4M13.8 5.2 17.2 8.6 13.8 12"/>
      <path d="M20.2 15.4H6.8M10.2 12 6.8 15.4 10.2 18.8"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'ok' -%}
    <svg class="tt-nc-ikon {{ sinif }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M9.2 5.6 15.6 12l-6.4 6.4"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'kapat' -%}
    <svg class="tt-nc-ikon {{ sinif }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M6.2 6.2 17.8 17.8M17.8 6.2 6.2 17.8"/>
    </svg>
{%- endcase -%}
